{"id":"624911","name":"虾仁西蓝花沙拉","author":"Dinaking","authorId":"12567629","desc":"","cover":"images/624911/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"10只"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"2片"},{"name":"西蓝花","amount":"三大朵"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"小番茄","amount":"10个"},{"name":"苹果","amount":"1/4个"}],"sub":[{"name":"六月鲜轻盐酱油","amount":"3勺"},{"name":"橄榄油","amount":"2勺"},{"name":"苹果醋","amount":"一包"},{"name":"黑胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好酱汁部分的材料。","img":"images/624911/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"橄榄油，苹果醋，六月鲜轻盐酱油，黑胡椒粉全部放入一个造中搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/624911/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"准备好所有食材。","img":"images/624911/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生菜洗干净晾干水份，切成丝。","img":"images/624911/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"苹果切成薄片。","img":"images/624911/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小番茄对半切开。","img":"images/624911/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"西蓝花洗干净焯水5分钟。","img":"images/624911/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"虾仁煮熟。","img":"images/624911/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"鸡蛋煮熟切成8块。","img":"images/624911/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把所有的食材摆入盘中。","img":"images/624911/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入之前填好的油醋汁。","img":"images/624911/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再搅拌均匀就可以吃了。","img":"images/624911/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"开始享用吧。","img":"images/624911/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}